  "purpose": {
    "summary": "Computes multi-axis Coherence Index (CI) tensor across all registered regime components; gates the Triadic Regime Synthesizer at CI ≥ 0.55.",
    "detail": "The CTE ingests the Drift Report (ΔM/ΔD/ΔV) and Structural Frame from the S3 Spine bus, decomposes integration quality into an N×N tensor of pairwise coherence coefficients across all active regime pairs, collapses the tensor to a scalar CI, and emits a synthesis gate signal (PASS if CI ≥ 0.55, HOLD otherwise). It also produces a fragmentation zone map identifying regime pairs below the coherence floor. The CTE runs continuously during Coherence Overlay execution and reports to CROSS_DOMAIN_CAUSALITY_WEAVER for cross-boundary loss tracing."
  },
